    <briefdescription>
<para>Feature disabled error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1FeatureDisabledError" kindref="compound">FeatureDisabledError</ref> represents an error where a feature is explicitly disabled by build configuration or policy.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>FeatureDisabledError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>FeatureDisabledError(&quot;Feature<sp/>disabled<sp/>by<sp/>security<sp/>policy&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
